                <pb facs="0247" n="1207" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1207"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 75.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bragg to Mr. Mariscal.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-03-29"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 29,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge receipt of
                    your excellency’s note dated yesterday, in which you make inquiry concerning the
                    nationality of Henry Brudigam, at Chihuahua. I have taken steps to establish
                    that point, and will communicate with your excellency as soon as I receive the
                    data.</p>
                <p>I beg, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Edwd. S. Bragg.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
